Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:30:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(api): LEGACY_READ_ONLY freezes writes and registration
 (v3 ticket 171)

One variable and a restart close writes, registration, password reset and
uploads (403); reads, search and sign-in stay. Unset it to undo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
